,"id":2678956835,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fraMj","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:11:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:11:09Z","body":"> What about other version fields, such as `build`?\r\n\r\n`status` was the only one I needed. I can add other fields if you want me to.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, I forgot `Engine::get_version_info` existed and, since that's already exposed to scripting, it covers my use case.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678956835/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678998191","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103199#issuecomment-2678998191","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103199","id":2678998191,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6frkSv","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-24T16:26:03Z","updated_at":"2025-02-24T16:26:03Z","body":"> What about other version fields, such as `build`?\r\n\r\nAh, yeah, we should probably include all the same information from [`Engine.get_version_info`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_engine.html#class-engine-method-get-version-info).\r\n\r\n> To be honest, I forgot `Engine::get_version_info` existed and, since that's already exposed to scripting, it covers my use case.\r\n\r\nFYI, having `get_godot_version` in the GDExtension interface is useful even with `Engine.get_version_info()` being available, in case we need to check the version before fully initializing the GDExtension. We're using this presently in godot-cpp, in order to bail early if a 4.1+ extension is loaded on 4.0, because we wouldn't even be able to initialize the GDExtension far enough to actually call `Engine.get_version_info()`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2678998191/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"pe